#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Test insights, sharding, and trustworthy feedback · Tuist"
msgstr "Test içgörüleri, parçalama ve güvenilir geri bildirim · Tuist"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/live/marketing_blog_live.ex:130
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
